WEBVTT

00:00:02.498 --> 00:00:02.603
DAD?

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:40.206
Harry: RON, YOU'VE
REALLY GOT TO SEE THIS!

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:42.033
RON, YOU'VE GOT
TO SEE THIS!

00:00:44.862 --> 00:00:46.908
RON!
RON, COME ON.

00:00:46.951 --> 00:00:48.170
GET OUT OF BED.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:49.345
WHY?

00:00:49.389 --> 00:00:50.346
THERE'S SOMETHING
YOU'VE GOT TO SEE.

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:52.000
NOW COME ON.

00:00:58.354 --> 00:00:59.964
COME ON. COME.

00:01:00.008 --> 00:01:01.531
COME LOOK.
IT'S MY PARENTS.

00:01:04.055 --> 00:01:06.145
I ONLY SEE US.

00:01:06.188 --> 00:01:09.757
LOOK IN PROPERLY.
GO ON, STAND THERE.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:10.758
THERE.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:11.933
YOU SEE THEM,
DON'T YOU?

00:01:11.976 --> 00:01:13.674
THAT'S ME,

00:01:13.717 --> 00:01:16.067
ONLY I'M HEAD BOY,

00:01:16.111 --> 00:01:18.940
AND I'M HOLDING
THE QUIDDITCH CUP.

00:01:18.983 --> 00:01:21.029
AND BLOODY HELL!

00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:23.379
I'M QUIDDITCH
CAPTAIN, TOO.

00:01:23.423 --> 00:01:27.166
I LOOK GOOD.

00:01:27.209 --> 00:01:31.344
HARRY, DO YOU THINK THIS
MIRROR SHOWS THE FUTURE?

00:01:31.387 --> 00:01:33.259
HOW CAN IT?

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:35.435
BOTH MY PARENTS ARE DEAD.

00:01:39.917 --> 00:01:41.919
[RAINING]

00:01:59.415 --> 00:02:01.983
BACK AGAIN, HARRY?

00:02:04.899 --> 00:02:07.554
I SEE THAT YOU,
LIKE SO MANY BEFORE YOU,

00:02:07.597 --> 00:02:10.905
HAVE DISCOVERED THE DELIGHTS
OF THE MIRROR OF ERISED.

00:02:10.948 --> 00:02:16.389
I TRUST BY NOW
YOU REALIZE WHAT IT DOES.

00:02:16.432 --> 00:02:20.436
LET ME GIVE YOU A CLUE.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.004
THE HAPPIEST MAN ON EARTH

00:02:23.047 --> 00:02:24.440
WOULD LOOK INTO THE MIRROR

00:02:24.484 --> 00:02:28.270
AND SEE ONLY HIMSELF
EXACTLY AS HE IS.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:32.318
SO THEN IT SHOWS US
WHAT WE WANT?

00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:34.189
WHATEVER WE WANT?

00:02:34.233 --> 00:02:37.061
YES...AND NO.

00:02:37.105 --> 00:02:40.326
IT SHOWS US
NOTHING MORE OR LESS

00:02:40.369 --> 00:02:41.588
THAN THE DEEPEST

00:02:41.631 --> 00:02:46.636
AND MOST DESPERATE
DESIRES OF OUR HEARTS.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.725
NOW YOU, HARRY,

00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:50.379
WHO HAVE NEVER KNOWN
YOUR FAMILY,

00:02:50.423 --> 00:02:55.776
YOU SEE THEM
STANDING BESIDE YOU.

00:02:55.819 --> 00:02:58.561
BUT REMEMBER THIS,
HARRY--

00:02:58.605 --> 00:03:01.434
THIS MIRROR GIVES US

00:03:01.477 --> 00:03:07.527
NEITHER KNOWLEDGE
OR TRUTH.

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:10.965
MEN HAVE WASTED AWAY
IN FRONT OF IT,

00:03:11.008 --> 00:03:13.097
EVEN GONE MAD.

00:03:14.838 --> 00:03:17.319
THAT IS WHY TOMORROW
IT WILL BE MOVED

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.103
TO A NEW HOME.

00:03:19.147 --> 00:03:21.280
AND I MUST ASK YOU

00:03:21.323 --> 00:03:26.546
NOT TO GO LOOKING
FOR IT AGAIN.

00:03:26.589 --> 00:03:27.938
IT DOES NOT DO

00:03:27.982 --> 00:03:29.940
TO DWELL ON DREAMS,
HARRY,

00:03:29.984 --> 00:03:31.373
AND FORGET TO LIVE.

